GCC 1.42 for the Macintosh Plus (uClinux)
=========================================

Origin
------
This directory is GNU CC version 1.42, unpacked from the official
gcc-1.42.tar.bz2 (https://gcc.gnu.org/pub/gcc/old-releases/gcc-1/).
It is used as the C compiler that runs ON the Mac (a 68000 with 4 MB of
RAM and no MMU), see user/cc/.

Licence
-------
